OL,3,GNEWSAFirst UK patient given
OL,4,Agroundbreaking diabetes drug
OL,5,
OL,6,FA patient has become the first in the
OL,7,FUK to receive a pioneering drug
OL,8,Fdesigned to delay the onset of Type 1
OL,9,Fdiabetes.
OL,11,FAnnette Quilter, from Shropshire,
OL,12,Freceived the first NHS dose of
OL,13,FTeplizumab at Queen Elizabeth Hospital
OL,14,FBirmingham (QEHB) this week.
OL,16,FThe treatment can delay the progression
OL,17,Fof early-stage Type 1 diabetes,
OL,18,Fpotentially giving patients more time
OL,19,Fbefore they need to start taking
OL,20,Finsulin.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
