OL,4,Agroundbreaking diabetes drug
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 42-year-old, who was diagnosed with
OL,7,FStage 2 Type 1 diabetes in the summer,
OL,8,Fwas identified as eligible following
OL,9,Fscreening and assessment.
